    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_natural_dyestuffs; land_basis=terrestrial_forest): Heading is explicitly a dyewood (fustic, Brazil wood, sapan, Nicaragua wood, red/Guinea wood, braziletto); filed with Dye Woods Logwood (htc:0096) rather than building timber. Layer-1 observations: 4 rows, 1800–1800. Series: KEW_CUST 5 ×4. Units: Tons ×4. Top routes: Holland → United Kingdom ×1; World → United Kingdom ×1; Ireland → United Kingdom ×1; The Americas → United Kingdom ×1."@en ;
